  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">F&#xf6;rsoning bland gymnstud</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Reconciliation among stud</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Seminarier f&#xf6;r kroatiska gymnasieungdomar fr&#xe5;n Osijek och Vinkovci och serbiska ungdomar fr&#xe5;n Vukovar gymnasium. Syftet med kurserna &#xe4;r att hj&#xe4;lpa dessa att vara toleranta och samarbeta med varandra n&#xe4;r de tr&#xe4;ffas p&#xe5; universiteten senare.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Seminars for Kroatian students from Osijek and Vinkovci and Serb students from Vukovar High School. The aim is to help these  students to be tolerant and to cooperate when they later meet at the universities.</narrative>
  </description>
